# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Twisteds Addon Platform - repo hygiene
# Keep dev tooling, scripts, and reference material OUT of what we push/ship.
# Only the addon folders (TAP, TAP_*) + user-facing docs (README/CHANGELOG/
# LICENSE/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES/ABOUT) belong in the repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/betaportal/

# Local agent doc: how to pull beta run logs from the portal API (never shipped)
/PULL_LOGS.md

# Reference copy of the old standalone addon (kept locally, never shipped)
/_TCC_source/

# UIFoundry parts pulled out of the shipped addon to save size: the Showcase demo
# gallery + reusable components no module uses yet. Kept locally for reference /
# future re-use, never shipped or pushed.
/_UIFoundry_lab/

# Dev-only plugin: Mythic Ledger mock-data generator (local testing only, never shipped/pushed)
/TAP_MythicLedger_Dev/

# Deploy / packaging / build scripts (local dev only)
/deploy.ps1
/package.ps1
*.ps1

# Asset-generation tooling (Python + source art). The generated .tga/.ttf assets
# that the addon actually loads ARE committed; the generators are not.
/TAP/tools/
**/tools/
*.py

# Internal docs: design notes, scoring/research references, audits, dev scratch,
# plus the CURSE.md store-listing copy (pasted to CurseForge by hand). The docs/
# folder is the single home for every non-user-facing .md (the shipped addons
# keep only README/CHANGELOG/LICENSE/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES/ABOUT).
/RotationKeybindCue.md
/NOTES.md
/scratch/
/docs/

# Support-bot context (private - for the live help AI agent, never shipped/pushed)
/context.md
/guardrails.md

# Local screenshots (dev captures, not part of the shipped addon)
/ScreenShots/

# Editor / IDE / assistant
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.code-workspace

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Build / release artifacts (produced by the release workflow)
/.stage/
/dist/
cf_response.json

# Temp / backup / logs
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.log
*.zip
